abstract = {The advances in database and communication technology demand for system availability and autonomy which can be attained through a distributed system. The challenge in distributed applications is how to distribute the data and program to obtain the intended performance while maintaining security and availability. Today, blockchain research is one of the emerging areas of computer science due to its potential to revolutionize the problem of trust in distributed systems. Blockchain is a decentralized peer-to-peer network, and it allows data to be stored in a server farm. There exists a sense of collective trust between the peers in this peer-to-peer network. Currently, blockchain technology is used in various other fields such as E-commerce systems, markets with exponential transactions, asset management entities, exchanges, etc.}
